<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 7/8.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 7/8.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 7/8. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>		 July 7/8	 July 4-7</p>
<p>    CZK	 0.43285	 0.4322</p>
<p>    DKK	 2.10041	 2.10058</p>
<p>    FIM	 2.68658	 2.68823</p>
<p>    GBP	23.50398	23.60233</p>
<p>    HUF	 0.0743	  0.0744</p>
<p>    LTL	 3.48719	 3.49939</p>
<p>    LVL	24.51763	24.55163</p>
<p>    RUR	 0.241	   0.00242</p>
<p>    SEK	 1.81062	 1.81705</p>
<p>    UAH	 7.51517	 7.54289</p>
<p>    USD	13.9444	 13.9932</p>
<p>    XEU	15.73695	15.73885</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
